since on MICU-7, has been difficult to adequately sedate pt d/t intubation for pt's comfort, yet maintain adequate b/p--received 3 separate 250 cc's NS boluses, with good effect;
   propofol changed over to fentanyl and versed, though small improvement in b/p;

pt's daughter ([**Name (NI) 4796**]) is ER nurse, wife [**Doctor First Name 6033**] goes by [**Doctor Last Name **])is [**Name (NI) 6034**] reportedly is ill at this time, so can call [**Location (un) 4796**];

FIO2 decreased from 0.60 down to 0.40 d/t pO2 in 300's in ABG drawn in ER; TV also decreased from 450 to 400;

tube feeds started at 4a, at 10 cc/hr;

